{"version":1,"pages":[{"id":"p1","title":"1. Home · proof (agents, before/after, paper trail, results) · cycle 4","shapes":[{"id":"doc-title-p1","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":0,"y":-860,"w":4400,"h":200},"text":"<p style='font-size:40pt;text-align:left'><b>Harvest concept site · Cycle 4 review (main 3dd76b4)</b><br><span style='font-size:20pt'>Home: agents, before/after, paper trail, results · Desktop 1440×1024 · commit 3dd76b4 · https://harvest-for-lucid.netlify.app</span></p>"},{"id":"legend-box-p1","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":0,"y":-560,"w":2600,"h":360},"text":"<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>How to review</b><br>Leave feedback as sticky notes INSIDE the screen's frame. Start a note with <b>Do:</b>, <b>Must do</b>, <b>Try:</b> or <b>Consider:</b> to set its priority (the words win over the colour); otherwise the colour counts: <span style='color:#C62828'><b>Red = Do / Must do</b></span>, <span style='color:#9A7B00'><b>Yellow = Try</b></span>, <span style='color:#1565C0'><b>Blue = Consider</b></span>. <span style='color:#BA23F6'><b>Purple = Board format</b></span> (notes about this board's layout). Comments are read as general feedback.</p>"},{"id":"legend-must-p1","type":"rectangle","boundingBox":{"x":2700,"y":-530,"w":260,"h":300},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#FF8A80"},"stroke":{"color":"#C62828","width":2,"style":"solid"}},"text":"<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Red</b><br>Do / Must do</p>"},{"id":"legend-try-p1","type":"rectangle","boundingBox":{"x":3020,"y":-530,"w":260,"h":300},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#FFE066"},"stroke":{"color":"#9A7B00","width":2,"style":"solid"}},"text":"<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Yellow</b><br>Try</p>"},{"id":"legend-maybe-p1","type":"rectangle","boundingBox":{"x":3340,"y":-530,"w":260,"h":300},"style":{"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#A3E4FF"},"stroke":{"color":"#1565C0","width":2,"style":"solid"}},"text":"<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b